<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Project 15 - Configured by Ansible</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #1a1a2e; color: #eee; text-align: center; padding-top: 60px; }
    .card { display: inline-block; background: #16213e; padding: 30px 50px; border-radius: 10px; text-align: left; }
    h1 { color: #e94560; }
    td { padding: 4px 12px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Project 15: Server Config with Ansible</h1>
    <p>This web server was installed and configured remotely by an Ansible playbook.</p>
    <table>
      <tr><td>Inventory host</td><td>{{ inventory_hostname }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Hostname</td><td>{{ ansible_facts['hostname'] }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Private IP</td><td>{{ ansible_facts['default_ipv4']['address'] }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>OS</td><td>{{ ansible_facts['distribution'] }} {{ ansible_facts['distribution_version'] }}</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Configured at</td><td>{{ ansible_facts['date_time']['iso8601'] }}</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
